        "Description": "47, this one is an odd one, I&apos;m not going to lie. Our client is a secret desendant of Toyotomi Hideyoshi, a 16th century Japanese feudal lord. they have identified five people working at GAMA who are desendants of Hideyoshi&apos;s rival, Tokugawa Leyasu, who is said to have influenced the destruction of his clan in 1615. The client wants revenge, four centuries late. To preserve the Toyotomi clan&apos;s honor, they want it done flawlessly, and in a manner fitting with the clan&apos;s practices. Good luck 47.",
